WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:11.110
Three drops. By morning, the truth will
come out.

2
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.930
Mama cooked it for you herself! Special
pepper soup!

3
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.250
Since when does Mama cook for me?

4
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.130
Drink it, my daughter. It's good for the
baby.

5
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.450
Go on now.

6
00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.500
Wait… what is this?

7
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.510
Jesus!

8
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.450
Mama, what did you put in this soup?!

9
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.510
It's anointing! Anointing! Anointing is a
little bitter!

10
00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.300
Ehn ehn! Trouble has landed!

11
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.240
Olorun mi! (My God!)

12
00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.820
Ada… I don't like this at all.

13
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.700
Show me.

14
00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.550
Mama, you first. You cooked it.

15
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.700
That was the day I knew… the soup wasn't
just for me.
